    "proven": [
      "The minimal ESP-IDF probe reproduces a spinlock owner mismatch in 3/3 independent sessions.",
      "The assertion occurs while the CPU0 main task exits xQueueSemaphoreTake, before the CPU1 worker reaches the partition-read start marker.",
