    "not_proven": [
      "Whether S32C1I compare-and-swap returns or writes an incorrect value.",
      "Which spinlock address has the mismatched owner.",
      "Whether the same model defect is the sole cause of the legacy UIFlow interrupt-WDT.",
      "Physical multicore, flash-cache, PSRAM or hardware behavior."
